{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TfejZC5ZiwxWYKxoYXfKnJ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '全 18 runs（9 seeds × 2 encoders × 3 strategies）完整复现 pilot pattern。\n2\t  Embedding mining 在两个 encoder 上均显著优于 random（Qwen +2.0pp, StarCoder +1.5pp, 95% CI\n3\t  下界 > 0）。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上条件性获益（+1.0pp, CI 下界 > 0），StarCoder 上无显著差异（-0.2pp, CI 含零）。\n4\t  BM25 baseline 实证关闭 CoCoHaNeRe 论证（BM25 vs random: Qwen -2.5pp, StarCoder -2.7pp）。\n5\t  SWE-bench Lite downstream +2.5pp embedding, +3.2pp dataflow resolve rate delta。\n6\t  三条 claim 原样成立，EMNLP Main 强投 framing 无需调整。 M2 full anchors — Qwen random R@1=0.545,\n7\t  embedding=0.565, dataflow=0.555; StarCoder random R@1=0.460, embedding=0.475, dataflow=0.458。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: SWE-bench Lite End-to-End Evaluation\n12\t  plan_id: plan_003\n13\t  description: '3 strategies × best Qwen checkpoint, Qwen3.6-27B agent, 300 SWE-bench\n14\t    Lite instances. Retriever 提供 top-k context files，agent 生成 patch，评估 resolve rate。\n15\t\n16\t    '\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    random_resolve_rate: 0.22\n19\t    random_resolved_count: 66\n20\t    embedding_resolve_rate: 0.245\n21\t    embedding_resolved_count: 73\n22\t    dataflow_resolve_rate: 0.252\n23\t    dataflow_resolved_count: 76\n24\t    embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.5\n25\t    dataflow_minus_random_pp: 3.2\n26\t    dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: 0.7\n27\t    total_instances: 300\n28\t    retriever_top_k: 5\n29\t    agent_model: Qwen3.6-27B\n30\t  result_rationale: 'Embedding retriever 在 SWE-bench 上提升 +2.5pp，因为 bug-fix patch 通常涉及与\n31\t    issue 描述 语义相似但非完全匹配的文件——embedding mining 训练使 retriever 更擅长区分\"近似但无关\" 与\"近似且相关\"的文件。Dataflow\n32\t    额外提升 +0.7pp（总 +3.2pp vs random）因为 SWE-bench patch 经常跨函数/跨模块（约 40% 涉及 caller-callee\n33\t    关系），dataflow negatives 训练使 retriever 理解\"调用链上的文件更可能共同出现在 patch 中\"。Delta 幅度从 retrieval\n34\t    R@1 的 +2.0/+1.0pp 放大到下游 resolve rate 的 +2.5/+3.2pp，符合检索质量在端到端任务中 的杠杆效应——正确检索一个关键文件可以使原本完全失败的\n35\t    patch 变为可解决。 效果幅度在 swebench_resolve_rate_delta_pp [1.5, 4.0] 范围内。\n36\t\n37\t    '\n38\t  tables:\n39\t  - name: 'Table 4: SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate'\n40\t    columns:\n41\t    - Strategy\n42\t    - Resolved\n43\t    - Total\n44\t    - Rate (%)\n45\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n46\t    rows:\n47\t    - - random\n48\t      - 66\n49\t      - 300\n50\t      - 22.0\n51\t      - —\n52\t    - - embedding\n53\t      - 73\n54\t      - 300\n55\t      - 24.3\n56\t      - '+2.3'\n57\t    - - dataflow\n58\t      - 76\n59\t      - 300\n60\t      - 25.3\n61\t      - '+3.3'\n62\t  - name: 'Table 4b: SWE-bench by Patch Complexity'\n63\t    columns:\n64\t    - Patch Type\n65\t    - N\n66\t    - random (%)\n67\t    - embedding (%)\n68\t    - dataflow (%)\n69\t    rows:\n70\t    - - single-file\n71\t      - 189\n72\t      - 28.0\n73\t      - 30.7\n74\t      - 30.2\n75\t    - - multi-file\n76\t      - 111\n77\t      - 11.7\n78\t      - 14.4\n79\t      - 17.1\n80\t  figures_description:\n81\t  - 'Fig 5: SWE-bench resolve rate bar chart (3 strategies) with bootstrap 95% CI\n82\t    whiskers'\n83\t  - 'Fig 5b: Scatter plot — retrieval R@1 rank vs resolve rate per instance, colored\n84\t    by strategy'\n85\t  analysis: 'Multi-file patches（占 37%）是 dataflow 拉开差距的主要来源：dataflow 在 multi-file 上\n86\t    +5.4pp vs random，远大于 single-file 的 +2.2pp。这与 Claim 2 一致——dataflow negatives 使\n87\t    retriever 更好地理解跨模块依赖。Embedding vs random 在 multi-file 上也有 +2.7pp，说明更难的 negatives\n88\t    普遍有益。总体 resolve rate 22-25% 与 SweRank/SWE-Fixer 文献报告的 retriever-only baseline\n89\t    一致。\n90\t\n91\t    '\n92\t- name: RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval with Multi-Seed CIs\n93\t  plan_id: plan_004\n94\t  description: 'RepoBench-R test_easy (pool ~6) 和 test_hard (pool ~18) 上评估 9 seeds\n95\t    × 3 strategies × 2 encoders，报告 R@1 均值 + 95% bootstrap CI。\n96\t\n97\t    '\n98\t  expected_results:\n99\t    qwen_test_hard:\n100\t      random_R1_mean: 0.621\n101\t      random_R1_ci:\n102\t      - 0.614\n103\t      - 0.628\n104\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.642\n105\t      embedding_R1_ci:\n106\t      - 0.634\n107\t      - 0.65\n108\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.633\n109\t      dataflow_R1_ci:\n110\t      - 0.624\n111\t      - 0.642\n112\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.1\n113\t      dataflow_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n114\t    qwen_test_easy:\n115\t      random_R1_mean: 0.843\n116\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.855\n117\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.85\n118\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n119\t    starcoder_test_hard:\n120\t      random_R1_mean: 0.574\n121\t      random_R1_ci:\n122\t      - 0.566\n123\t      - 0.582\n124\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.589\n125\t      embedding_R1_ci:\n126\t      - 0.58\n127\t      - 0.598\n128\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.572\n129\t      dataflow_R1_ci:\n130\t      - 0.562\n131\t      - 0.582\n132\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n133\t      dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.2\n134\t    starcoder_test_easy:\n135\t      random_R1_mean: 0.812\n136\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.822\n137\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.81\n138\t    repobench_R1_delta_pp_embedding_avg: 1.8\n139\t    bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp_avg: 1.2\n140\t  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 是 cross-file completion 任务，pool 更小（6-18），绝对 R@1 更高。\n141\t    Embedding mining 在两个 encoder 上均显著提升 test_hard R@1（Qwen +2.1pp, StarCoder +1.5pp），\n142\t    因为 pool=18 仍有足够 distractors 使 mining 质量差异体现。Test_easy pool=6 接近 ceiling，delta\n143\t    被压缩但方向一致。Dataflow 在 Qwen test_hard 上 +1.2pp 但 CI 刚好 排除零，StarCoder 上无效（-0.2pp，CI\n144\t    含零）——与 SWE-smith 上的 encoder-strategy interaction 完全一致，说明 pattern 跨 benchmark 稳定。CI\n145\t    宽度 ~1.2pp 在 bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp [0.5, 2.0] 范围内，9 seeds 提供足够统计功效。\n146\t\n147\t    '\n148\t  tables:\n149\t  - name: 'Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)'\n150\t    columns:\n151\t    - Encoder\n152\t    - Strategy\n153\t    - R@1 (%)\n154\t    - 95% CI\n155\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n156\t    rows:\n157\t    - - Qwen\n158\t      - random\n159\t      - 62.1\n160\t      - '[61.4, 62.8]'\n161\t      - —\n162\t    - - Qwen\n163\t      - embedding\n164\t      - 64.2\n165\t      - '[63.4, 65.0]'\n166\t      - '+2.1'\n167\t    - - Qwen\n168\t      - dataflow\n169\t      - 63.3\n170\t      - '[62.4, 64.2]'\n171\t      - '+1.2'\n172\t    - - StarCoder\n173\t      - random\n174\t      - 57.4\n175\t      - '[56.6, 58.2]'\n176\t      - —\n177\t    - - StarCoder\n178\t      - embedding\n179\t      - 58.9\n180\t      - '[58.0, 59.8]'\n181\t      - '+1.5'\n182\t    - - StarCoder\n183\t      - dataflow\n184\t      - 57.2\n185\t      - '[56.2, 58.2]'\n186\t      - −0.2\n187\t  figures_description:\n188\t  - 'Fig 6: RepoBench-R R@1 grouped bar chart (2 encoders × 3 strategies) with CI\n189\t    whiskers, test_easy vs test_hard side by side'\n190\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark 一致性是 best tier 的关键证据：embedding mining 在 SWE-smith 和 RepoBench-R\n191\t    上均显著提升两个 encoder，dataflow 条件性获益仅限 Qwen。这排除了 \"结果仅限单一 benchmark\" 的 reviewer concern。Test_easy\n192\t    上 delta 被压缩（pool=6 ceiling effect）是预期行为，反向验证了 pool size 对绝对效果幅度的调节作用。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t- name: Stratified Analysis with Structural Coverage & Neg Difficulty Quartiles\n196\t  plan_id: plan_005\n197\t  description: '5 层分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-positive similarity / structural\n198\t    data availability (34% vs 66%) / neg_difficulty quartile。使用 M2 best checkpoints\n199\t    在 SWE-smith validation 上重新评估。\n200\t\n201\t    '\n202\t  expected_results:\n203\t    stratum_structural_available:\n204\t      with_dataflow_34pct:\n205\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 2.8\n206\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: 1.3\n207\t        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n208\t        n_instances: ~5200\n209\t      fallback_66pct:\n210\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n211\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: -0.2\n212\t        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.3\n213\t        n_instances: ~10000\n214\t    stratum_neg_difficulty_quartile:\n215\t      Q1_easiest:\n216\t        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n217\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.3\n218\t      Q2:\n219\t        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n220\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.7\n221\t      Q3:\n222\t        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.4\n223\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n224\t      Q4_hardest:\n225\t        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 3.2\n226\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 2.1\n227\t    stratum_repo_size:\n228\t      small_lt50:\n229\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.8\n230\t        n: ~500\n231\t      medium_50_200:\n232\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.2\n233\t        n: ~4100\n234\t      large_200_500:\n235\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.8\n236\t        n: ~5500\n237\t      xlarge_500plus:\n238\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.6\n239\t        n: ~5100\n240\t    stratum_pool_size:\n241\t      pool_lt20:\n242\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.0\n243\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.3\n244\t      pool_20_50:\n245\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.1\n246\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.0\n247\t      pool_gt50:\n248\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.5\n249\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.4\n250\t    stratum_query_pos_sim:\n251\t      high_sim_gt095:\n252\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.6\n253\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.8\n254\t      medium_sim_085_095:\n255\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.9\n256\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.8\n257\t      low_sim_lt085:\n258\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.2\n259\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.2\n260\t  result_rationale: 'Structural-available stratum（34%）上 dataflow 优势放大到 +2.8pp（Qwen），因为这些\n261\t    instance 实际接收了 dataflow-disconnected negatives——真实训练信号未被 fallback 稀释。 Fallback\n262\t    stratum（66%）上 dataflow ≈ embedding（±0.2pp），因为 fallback 时 dataflow 策略退化为 embedding\n263\t    或 random 选择，无结构信号注入。这一分解直接回应 reviewer 关于 \"34% coverage 稀释 signal\" 的 concern——真实\n264\t    per-instance 效果是 +2.8pp 而非 pooled +1.0pp。Neg_difficulty Q4（最难 quartile）上 delta\n265\t    最大（embedding +3.2pp, dataflow +2.1pp），符合 representation saturation 理论——Qwen 在高\n266\t    pos_sim 区域最需要 harder negatives，而 Q4 恰好是 margin 最小、分辨最难的 instances。Q1（最容易）delta\n267\t    最小 因为 random negatives 已经足够容易区分。Repo size 上 small repo delta 更大因为 小 repo 的 candidate\n268\t    pool 更集中，mining 策略差异更容易体现。\n269\t\n270\t    '\n271\t  tables:\n272\t  - name: 'Table 7: Stratified R@1 Delta by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)'\n273\t    columns:\n274\t    - Stratum\n275\t    - N\n276\t    - random R@1\n277\t    - embedding R@1\n278\t    - dataflow R@1\n279\t    - df−rand (pp)\n280\t    rows:\n281\t    - - With dataflow (34%)\n282\t      - ~5.2K\n283\t      - 53.1\n284\t      - 55.4\n285\t      - 55.9\n286\t      - '+2.8'\n287\t    - - Fallback (66%)\n288\t      - ~10K\n289\t      - 55.2\n290\t      - 57.3\n291\t      - 55.3\n292\t      - '+0.1'\n293\t    - - Overall\n294\t      - ~15.2K\n295\t      - 54.5\n296\t      - 56.5\n297\t      - 55.5\n298\t      - '+1.0'\n299\t  - name: 'Table 7b: R@1 Delta by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen)'\n300\t    columns:\n301\t    - Quartile\n302\t    - margin_mean\n303\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n304\t    - df−rand (pp)\n305\t    rows:\n306\t    - - Q1 (easiest)\n307\t      - 0.142\n308\t      - '+0.8'\n309\t      - '+0.3'\n310\t    - - Q2\n311\t      - 0.078\n312\t      - '+1.5'\n313\t      - '+0.7'\n314\t    - - Q3\n315\t      - 0.031\n316\t      - '+2.4'\n317\t      - '+1.2'\n318\t    - - Q4 (hardest)\n319\t      - 0.008\n320\t      - '+3.2'\n321\t      - '+2.1'\n322\t  figures_description:\n323\t  - 'Fig 7: Heatmap — R@1 delta (strategy × stratum), separate panels for Qwen and\n324\t    StarCoder'\n325\t  - 'Fig 8: Neg difficulty quartile vs R@1 delta line plot, 3 strategies overlaid'\n326\t  analysis: 'Stratified analysis 提供了论文中最强的 mechanistic 证据。Neg_difficulty Q4 的 +3.2pp\n327\t    embedding delta 是 overall +2.0pp 的 1.6 倍——越难的 instances 从 harder negatives 获益越多，这是\n328\t    representation saturation 理论的直接预测。Structural-available vs fallback 分解消除了 \"diluted\n329\t    signal\" concern 并揭示 dataflow 的真实 per-instance 效果（+2.8pp）远大于 pooled 报告值。\n330\t\n331\t    '\n332\t- name: Call-Graph Hop Depth Ablation (1/2/3-hop)\n333\t  plan_id: plan_007\n334\t  description: '比较 1-hop / 2-hop / 3-hop call-graph bounding 对 dataflow negative 质量的影响。\n335\t    Qwen encoder, 1 seed, SWE-smith validation。\n336\t\n337\t    '\n338\t  expected_results:\n339\t    hop_1:\n340\t      R1: 0.548\n341\t      connected_coverage_pct: 12.4\n342\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 18.2\n343\t    hop_2:\n344\t      R1: 0.555\n345\t      connected_coverage_pct: 34.3\n346\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 31.7\n347\t    hop_3:\n348\t      R1: 0.551\n349\t      connected_coverage_pct: 58.6\n350\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 42.1\n351\t    optimal_hop: 2\n352\t    hop2_minus_hop1_pp: 0.7\n353\t    hop3_minus_hop2_pp: -0.4\n354\t  result_rationale: '2-hop 是最优平衡点。1-hop 太保守——仅 12.4% coverage 意味着大部分 instance 没有足够的\n355\t    connected 节点来定义 \"disconnected\" negatives，退化为 random。3-hop 过于宽松——58.6% coverage\n356\t    下 \"disconnected\" 的定义变得太窄，许多语义相关但间接连接的文件被错误排除在 negative pool 外，引入噪声。2-hop 的 34.3%\n357\t    coverage（与 M1 extraction 的 structural data rate 一致）在 \"enough connected nodes to\n358\t    define meaningful disconnection\" 和 \"disconnected set still contains genuinely\n359\t    unrelated files\" 之间取得平衡。\n360\t\n361\t    '\n362\t  tables:\n363\t  - name: 'Table 9: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)'\n364\t    columns:\n365\t    - Hops\n366\t    - Coverage (%)\n367\t    - Neg/query\n368\t    - R@1 (%)\n369\t    - Δ vs 2-hop (pp)\n370\t    rows:\n371\t    - - 1\n372\t      - 12.4\n373\t      - 18.2\n374\t      - 54.8\n375\t      - −0.7\n376\t    - - 2\n377\t      - 34.3\n378\t      - 31.7\n379\t      - 55.5\n380\t      - —\n381\t    - - 3\n382\t      - 58.6\n383\t      - 42.1\n384\t      - 55.1\n385\t      - −0.4\n386\t  figures_description:\n387\t  - 'Fig S1: Hop depth vs R@1 line plot with coverage % on secondary y-axis'\n388\t  analysis: '2-hop optimal 符合 inter-procedural dataflow 的语义：1-hop = 直接 caller/callee，\n389\t    2-hop = caller 的 caller 或 callee 的 callee（一层间接调用），3-hop 开始包含 过于间接的关系。论文可以强调 2-hop\n390\t    选择有 principled 依据而非纯粹 empirical tuning。\n391\t\n392\t    '\n393\t- name: Training Data Size Scaling (1K/3K/5K)\n394\t  plan_id: plan_008\n395\t  description: '固定 Qwen encoder + embedding strategy，训练数据从 1K / 3K / 5K instances\n396\t    增长， 观察 R@1 变化和策略排名稳定性。\n397\t\n398\t    '\n399\t  expected_results:\n400\t    size_1K:\n401\t      random_R1: 0.51\n402\t      embedding_R1: 0.522\n403\t      dataflow_R1: 0.515\n404\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n405\t      seed_std: 0.015\n406\t    size_3K:\n407\t      random_R1: 0.532\n408\t      embedding_R1: 0.55\n409\t      dataflow_R1: 0.541\n410\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.8\n411\t      seed_std: 0.01\n412\t    size_5K:\n413\t      random_R1: 0.545\n414\t      embedding_R1: 0.565\n415\t      dataflow_R1: 0.555\n416\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n417\t      seed_std: 0.008\n418\t    ranking_stable: true\n419\t    monotonic_improvement: true\n420\t  result_rationale: '策略排名在 1K/3K/5K 三个尺度上保持一致（embedding > dataflow > random），但 delta\n421\t    幅度随数据量增大而增大——1K 时 +1.2pp，5K 时 +2.0pp。这是因为更大的训练集提供更多 diverse negatives，使 mining\n422\t    策略的差异更充分地体现。1K 时 seed 方差较大（std=0.015） 因为 negative 多样性不足，个别 seed 的 negative 采样偶然性影响结果。5K\n423\t    时方差收敛 （std=0.008），mining 策略的信号超过采样噪声。No diminishing returns at 5K suggests further\n424\t    scaling could help, but is beyond scope。\n425\t\n426\t    '\n427\t  tables:\n428\t  - name: 'Table 10: Data Size Scaling (Qwen)'\n429\t    columns:\n430\t    - Size\n431\t    - random R@1\n432\t    - embedding R@1\n433\t    - dataflow R@1\n434\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n435\t    - σ across seeds\n436\t    rows:\n437\t    - - 1K\n438\t      - 51.0\n439\t      - 52.2\n440\t      - 51.5\n441\t      - '+1.2'\n442\t      - 1.5\n443\t    - - 3K\n444\t      - 53.2\n445\t      - 55.0\n446\t      - 54.1\n447\t      - '+1.8'\n448\t      - 1.0\n449\t    - - 5K\n450\t      - 54.5\n451\t      - 56.5\n452\t      - 55.5\n453\t      - '+2.0'\n454\t      - 0.8\n455\t  figures_description:\n456\t  - 'Fig S2: R@1 vs training size for 3 strategies, with shaded seed variance bands'\n457\t  analysis: 'Monotonic scaling + stable ranking 表明结果不是 small-data artifact。5K 时未见\n458\t    diminishing returns，暗示更大数据集可能进一步放大差异。这对 reviewer \"effect size marginal\" concern\n459\t    有价值——delta 仍在增长，当前 +2.0pp 是下界而非上界。\n460\t\n461\t    '\n462\t- name: Fusion Head Ablation\n463\t  plan_id: plan_009\n464\t  description: '比较 embedding-only / structural-features-only / combined fusion head，\n465\t    隔离 training-time mining 价值与 inference-time feature injection。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t  expected_results:\n469\t    embedding_only:\n470\t      qwen_R1: 0.565\n471\t      starcoder_R1: 0.475\n472\t    structural_features_only:\n473\t      qwen_R1: 0.498\n474\t      starcoder_R1: 0.421\n475\t    combined_fusion:\n476\t      qwen_R1: 0.561\n477\t      starcoder_R1: 0.472\n478\t    embedding_only_minus_combined_pp: 0.4\n479\t    conclusion: mining > fusion; structural features at inference add noise\n480\t  result_rationale: 'Embedding-only（仅用 embedding mining 训练的 retriever，inference 时不注入结构特征）\n481\t    表现最好或 tied with combined。Combined fusion 略低 0.4pp 因为 inference-time structural\n482\t    features 引入了不精确的 CodeQL connectivity 信号——recall 某些 CodeQL extraction 失败的 instance\n483\t    反而被错误降权。Structural-features-only（不用 mining 训练， 仅在 inference 注入结构特征）远低于 embedding-only（-6.7pp\n484\t    Qwen），证明核心价值在 training-time negative mining 而非 inference-time feature engineering。\n485\t    这一结果对 paper framing 极为重要：StructFuse 的贡献是 mining strategy，不是 fusion。\n486\t\n487\t    '\n488\t  tables:\n489\t  - name: 'Table 11: Fusion Head Ablation'\n490\t    columns:\n491\t    - Configuration\n492\t    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n493\t    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n494\t    rows:\n495\t    - - embedding-only (ours)\n496\t      - 56.5\n497\t      - 47.5\n498\t    - - structural-features-only\n499\t      - 49.8\n500\t      - 42.1\n501\t    - - combined fusion\n502\t      - 56.1\n503\t      - 47.2\n504\t  figures_description:\n505\t  - 'Fig S3: Ablation bar chart comparing 3 fusion configurations'\n506\t  analysis: '训练时注入 structural signal 通过 negative mining（间接信号）比 inference 时直接注入 structural\n507\t    features（直接信号）更有效。可能原因：mining 让 encoder 自己学习结构相关的 representation，而直接注入 features\n508\t    绕过了 encoder 的学习过程，且 CodeQL 34% coverage 意味着 66% instance 在 inference 时收到 zero-vector\n509\t    structural features，引入 noise。\n510\t\n511\t    '\n512\t- name: Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\n513\t  plan_id: plan_010\n514\t  description: '比较 binary connected/disconnected 与 dataflow-distance weighted negative\n515\t    sampling。 Weighted: disconnected 且 hop-distance 更远的文件被赋予更高采样概率。\n516\t\n517\t    '\n518\t  expected_results:\n519\t    binary_qwen_R1: 0.555\n520\t    weighted_qwen_R1: 0.558\n521\t    binary_starcoder_R1: 0.458\n522\t    weighted_starcoder_R1: 0.459\n523\t    weighted_minus_binary_qwen_pp: 0.3\n524\t    weighted_minus_binary_starcoder_pp: 0.1\n525\t  result_rationale: 'Weighted 在 Qwen 上仅微弱提升 +0.3pp（不显著），StarCoder 上几乎无差异。 原因：binary\n526\t    disconnected/connected 已经捕获了最关键的 structural distinction—— \"是否在调用链上\"。进一步按 hop distance\n527\t    加权引入的额外信号被 noise 抵消：距离更远 不一定意味着更好的 negative（一个完全无关的 utility 文件可能 hop=∞ 但也是 trivial\n528\t    negative）。 Binary 的简洁性是优势——fewer hyperparameters, same effect。\n529\t\n530\t    '\n531\t  tables:\n532\t  - name: 'Table S1: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives'\n533\t    columns:\n534\t    - Method\n535\t    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n536\t    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n537\t    - Δ vs Binary (pp)\n538\t    rows:\n539\t    - - Binary (default)\n540\t      - 55.5\n541\t      - 45.8\n542\t      - —\n543\t    - - Distance-weighted\n544\t      - 55.8\n545\t      - 45.9\n546\t      - +0.3 / +0.1\n547\t  figures_description: []\n548\t  analysis: 'Binary is sufficient — complexity of weighted sampling not justified.\n549\t    论文可在 ablation section 用一句话报告这一 negative result， 强化 \"simple binary structural signal\n550\t    is the key insight\" 的 narrative。\n551\t\n552\t    '\n553\t- name: SWE-bench Failure Analysis (50 cases)\n554\t  plan_id: plan_011\n555\t  description: '从 random retriever 的 SWE-bench 失败案例中抽样 50 个，人工分类失败原因， 标注 dataflow\n556\t    信号是否可能帮助。\n557\t\n558\t    '\n559\t  expected_results:\n560\t    total_analyzed: 50\n561\t    category_breakdown:\n562\t      retrieval_failure_wrong_files: 22\n563\t      retrieval_success_but_agent_fail: 15\n564\t      insufficient_context_window: 7\n565\t      test_environment_issue: 4\n566\t      ambiguous_issue_description: 2\n567\t    dataflow_could_help:\n568\t      true: 14\n569\t      partially: 5\n570\t      false: 31\n571\t    dataflow_help_rate: 0.28\n572\t    key_pattern: '14/22 retrieval failures involve cross-module dependencies where\n573\t      the gold file is a caller/callee of a retrieved-but-wrong file — dataflow connectivity\n574\t      would directly address these.\n575\t\n576\t      '\n577\t  result_rationale: '50 个失败中 22 个是 retrieval failure（检索到错误文件），其中 14 个涉及跨模块依赖—— 被检索的文件和\n578\t    gold 文件有高文本相似度但分属不同 call chain。Dataflow negatives 训练 恰好针对这类 confound。15 个 retrieval\n579\t    success but agent fail 说明 retrieval 不是 唯一瓶颈——agent 的 patch 生成能力也是限制因素。这为论文提供了\n580\t    \"ceiling analysis\"： 即使 perfect retrieval，resolve rate 上限约 85%（15% 是 agent 能力限制）。\n581\t\n582\t    '\n583\t  tables:\n584\t  - name: 'Table S2: Failure Category Breakdown'\n585\t    columns:\n586\t    - Category\n587\t    - Count\n588\t    - '% of 50'\n589\t    - Dataflow Could Help?\n590\t    rows:\n591\t    - - 'Retrieval: wrong files'\n592\t      - 22\n593\t      - 44\n594\t      - 14/22 (64%)\n595\t    - - Retrieval OK, agent fail\n596\t      - 15\n597\t      - 30\n598\t      - N/A\n599\t    - - Context window limit\n600\t      - 7\n601\t      - 14\n602\t      - 5/7 partially\n603\t    - - Test env issue\n604\t      - 4\n605\t      - 8\n606\t      - 'No'\n607\t    - - Ambiguous issue\n608\t      - 2\n609\t      - 4\n610\t      - 'No'\n611\t  figures_description:\n612\t  - 'Fig S4: Sankey diagram — failure flow from retrieval stage to resolution outcome'\n613\t  analysis: '28% of failures could benefit from dataflow signal, consistent with the\n614\t    observed +3.2pp resolve rate improvement. The 64% rate within retrieval failures\n615\t    confirms that cross-module dependency is the primary retrieval challenge, directly\n616\t    supporting Claim 2''s motivation.\n617\t\n618\t    '\n619\t- name: Qualitative Examples (5-10 cases)\n620\t  plan_id: plan_012\n621\t  description: '从 SWE-bench 和 SWE-smith 中选取 5-10 个 dataflow negatives 改变检索结果的典型案例，\n622\t    展示 structural signal 的具体作用机制。\n623\t\n624\t    '\n625\t  expected_results:\n626\t    total_examples: 8\n627\t    example_categories:\n628\t      caller_callee_confusion: 3\n629\t      utility_file_distraction: 2\n630\t      cross_module_import_chain: 2\n631\t      test_file_vs_source: 1\n632\t    illustrative_example:\n633\t      issue: django/django#12345 — QuerySet.filter() returns wrong results with nested\n634\t        Q objects\n635\t      random_retriever_top1: django/db/models/query.py (text match on 'filter')\n636\t      dataflow_retriever_top1: django/db/models/sql/query.py (actual SQL generation\n637\t        called by filter)\n638\t      gold: django/db/models/sql/query.py\n639\t      explanation: 'Random retriever picks query.py (contains ''filter'' method signature)\n640\t        but the bug is in sql/query.py (the downstream SQL builder called by filter).\n641\t        Dataflow training teaches the model that sql/query.py is structurally connected\n642\t        to query.py via 2-hop call chain, making it a better negative for other instances,\n643\t        which in turn improves the model''s ability to rank the actual implementation\n644\t        file higher.\n645\t\n646\t        '\n647\t  result_rationale: '8 个案例覆盖 4 个失败模式：caller-callee confusion（3 个，最常见——文本相似的 wrapper\n648\t    函数 vs 实际实现）、utility file distraction（2 个——高文本重叠的 helper 文件干扰）、 cross-module import\n649\t    chain（2 个——A 导入 B 导入 C，bug 在 C 但文本匹配 A）、test vs source（1 个——test file 包含几乎完整的\n650\t    source code 复制）。这些案例具体展示了 \"lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance\" 的核心 insight。\n651\t\n652\t    '\n653\t  tables: []\n654\t  figures_description:\n655\t  - 'Fig 9: Side-by-side retrieval ranking visualization for 3 representative cases,\n656\t    showing file dependency graph with highlighted paths'\n657\t  analysis: 'Qualitative examples serve as the paper''s \"aha moment\" — they make the\n658\t    abstract representation geometry argument concrete. Reviewer-facing value: even\n659\t    skeptics who question statistical significance can see the mechanism operating\n660\t    on real code.\n661\t\n662\t    '\n663\t- name: Temperature Ablation τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}\n664\t  plan_id: plan_014\n665\t  description: '3 temperatures × 3 strategies × 2 encoders, 1 seed each. 测试 strategy\n666\t    ranking 是否 regime-specific。\n667\t\n668\t    '\n669\t  expected_results:\n670\t    tau_005:\n671\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.558\n672\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.577\n673\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.569\n674\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.9\n675\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.47\n676\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.485\n677\t      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.467\n678\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n679\t    tau_010:\n680\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.545\n681\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.565\n682\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.555\n683\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n684\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.46\n685\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.475\n686\t      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.458\n687\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n688\t    tau_020:\n689\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.53\n690\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.546\n691\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.538\n692\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.6\n693\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.448\n694\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.461\n695\t      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.447\n696\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n697\t    ranking_preserved_across_tau: true\n698\t    optimal_tau: 0.05\n699\t  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding\n700\t    > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在三个 temperature 下保持一致。τ=0.05 绝对性能最高因为 sharper\n701\t    temperature 使 contrastive loss 更有效地区分相似度差异（harder gradient signal）。 τ=0.2 下所有策略性能下降且\n702\t    delta 缩小（1.6pp vs 2.0pp），因为 softer temperature 减弱了 negative 选择质量的影响——当所有 similarity\n703\t    被压缩到窄范围内，hard vs easy negatives 的梯度差异变小。关键结论：findings 不是 temperature-regime-specific，\n704\t    直接回应 median reviewer 的 \"τ=0.05 unusually low\" concern。\n705\t\n706\t    '\n707\t  tables:\n708\t  - name: 'Table 8: Temperature Ablation (R@1 %)'\n709\t    columns:\n710\t    - τ\n711\t    - Encoder\n712\t    - random\n713\t    - embedding\n714\t    - dataflow\n715\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n716\t    rows:\n717\t    - - 0.05\n718\t      - Qwen\n719\t      - 55.8\n720\t      - 57.7\n721\t      - 56.9\n722\t      - '+1.9'\n723\t    - - 0.05\n724\t      - StarCoder\n725\t      - 47.0\n726\t      - 48.5\n727\t      - 46.7\n728\t      - '+1.5'\n729\t    - - 0.1\n730\t      - Qwen\n731\t      - 54.5\n732\t      - 56.5\n733\t      - 55.5\n734\t      - '+2.0'\n735\t    - - 0.1\n736\t      - StarCoder\n737\t      - 46.0\n738\t      - 47.5\n739\t      - 45.8\n740\t      - '+1.5'\n741\t    - - 0.2\n742\t      - Qwen\n743\t      - 53.0\n744\t      - 54.6\n745\t      - 53.8\n746\t      - '+1.6'\n747\t    - - 0.2\n748\t      - StarCoder\n749\t      - 44.8\n750\t      - 46.1\n751\t      - 44.7\n752\t      - '+1.3'\n753\t  figures_description:\n754\t  - 'Fig S5: Temperature × strategy interaction plot (R@1 on y-axis, τ on x-axis,\n755\t    separate lines per strategy)'\n756\t  analysis: 'Ranking stability across τ 是重要的 robustness evidence。τ=0.2 下 delta 缩小但\n757\t    不翻转，说明 mining quality 的价值在不同 loss sharpness 下都存在。Paper 可以报告 τ=0.05 作为 alternative\n758\t    best configuration 但选择 τ=0.1 作为 default（更常见的 literature default）。\n759\t\n760\t    '\n761\t- name: Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\n762\t  plan_id: plan_015\n763\t  description: 'Dynamic: 每 epoch 重新用当前 encoder 挖 embedding negatives。 Static: 仅用 pretrained\n764\t    encoder 挖一次（当前做法）。 Qwen + StarCoder, 1 seed each。\n765\t\n766\t    '\n767\t  expected_results:\n768\t    qwen_static_R1: 0.565\n769\t    qwen_dynamic_R1: 0.568\n770\t    qwen_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.3\n771\t    starcoder_static_R1: 0.475\n772\t    starcoder_dynamic_R1: 0.477\n773\t    starcoder_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.2\n774\t    dynamic_significant: false\n775\t    curriculum_confound_ruled_out: true\n776\t  result_rationale: 'Dynamic mining 仅微弱提升 +0.2-0.3pp（不显著），因为 LoRA rank 16 的 fine-tuning\n777\t    只轻微改变 embedding space——pretrained encoder 的 nearest neighbors 在训练后 仍然大部分相同。这排除了\n778\t    \"static mining 的优势来自 curriculum effect（early epochs 看到 harder negatives 然后 negatives\n779\t    变 stale）\" 的 confound——即使更新 negatives， 效果几乎不变。对 Claim 2 很重要：说明 mining strategy\n780\t    的选择（what to mine）比 mining schedule（when to mine）更关键。Dynamic mining 的 compute overhead（每\n781\t    epoch 重新 encode + kNN）不 justified。\n782\t\n783\t    '\n784\t  tables:\n785\t  - name: 'Table 13: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining'\n786\t    columns:\n787\t    - Encoder\n788\t    - Static R@1 (%)\n789\t    - Dynamic R@1 (%)\n790\t    - Δ (pp)\n791\t    - p-value\n792\t    rows:\n793\t    - - Qwen\n794\t      - 56.5\n795\t      - 56.8\n796\t      - '+0.3'\n797\t      - 0.41\n798\t    - - StarCoder\n799\t      - 47.5\n800\t      - 47.7\n801\t      - '+0.2'\n802\t      - 0.53\n803\t  figures_description:\n804\t  - 'Fig S6: Learning curves for static vs dynamic mining, overlaid'\n805\t  analysis: 'Static ≈ dynamic 是 clean negative result，强化了论文 narrative：关键是 negative\n806\t    的 semantic quality（embedding vs random vs dataflow），不是 freshness。 也简化了 practitioner\n807\t    recommendation——mine once from pretrained, no need for per-epoch re-mining。\n808\t\n809\t    '\n810\t- name: Bootstrap CIs for SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\n811\t  plan_id: plan_016\n812\t  description: '对 plan_003 的 SWE-bench 结果计算 10K bootstrap resamples 的 95% CI， 报告 paired\n813\t    difference CIs 和 p-values。\n814\t\n815\t    '\n816\t  expected_results:\n817\t    embedding_minus_random:\n818\t      delta_pp: 2.5\n819\t      ci_95:\n820\t      - 0.7\n821\t      - 4.3\n822\t      p_value: 0.018\n823\t      significant: true\n824\t    dataflow_minus_random:\n825\t      delta_pp: 3.2\n826\t      ci_95:\n827\t      - 1.0\n828\t      - 5.5\n829\t      p_value: 0.008\n830\t      significant: true\n831\t    dataflow_minus_embedding:\n832\t      delta_pp: 0.7\n833\t      ci_95:\n834\t      - -1.5\n835\t      - 2.9\n836\t      p_value: 0.134\n837\t      significant: false\n838\t    bootstrap_n: 10000\n839\t    sample_size: 300\n840\t  result_rationale: 'Embedding vs random CI [0.7, 4.3] 排除零（p=0.018），确认 embedding mining\n841\t    在下游 任务上的统计显著提升。Dataflow vs random 更显著（p=0.008）因为 delta 更大且 SWE-bench 中 cross-module\n842\t    patches 对 dataflow signal 响应一致。Dataflow vs embedding 不显著 （p=0.134, CI 含零）——300\n843\t    instances 的 power 不足以区分 +0.7pp 的小 delta，这是 expected：retrieval level 的 ~1pp 差异在下游\n844\t    binary resolve 结果上被放大和噪声化。 CI 宽度 ~3.6pp 反映 300 样本的 inherent variance——SWE-bench\n845\t    Lite 不是为精确 delta 估计设计的 benchmark。\n846\t\n847\t    '\n848\t  tables:\n849\t  - name: 'Table 4c: SWE-bench Bootstrap Significance Tests'\n850\t    columns:\n851\t    - Comparison\n852\t    - Δ (pp)\n853\t    - 95% CI\n854\t    - p-value\n855\t    rows:\n856\t    - - embedding − random\n857\t      - '+2.5'\n858\t      - '[+0.7, +4.3]'\n859\t      - 0.018\n860\t    - - dataflow − random\n861\t      - '+3.2'\n862\t      - '[+1.0, +5.5]'\n863\t      - 0.008\n864\t    - - dataflow − embedding\n865\t      - '+0.7'\n866\t      - '[−1.5, +2.9]'\n867\t      - 0.134\n868\t  figures_description:\n869\t  - 'Fig 5c: Bootstrap distribution histograms for the 3 pairwise comparisons'\n870\t  analysis: 'CI 下界 > 0 for both mining strategies vs random 是 EMNLP reviewer 需要的统计保证。\n871\t    Dataflow vs embedding 不显著是 honest reporting 且与 Claim 2 的 \"conditional\" framing\n872\t    一致——dataflow 的额外价值不是 universally separable at SWE-bench scale。\n873\t\n874\t    '\n875\t- name: Inference-Time Graph Method Literature Comparison\n876\t  plan_id: plan_017\n877\t  description: '文献分析（非实验）：与 CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER 等 inference-time 图方法的 系统比较。已完成\n878\t    8 篇论文 survey。\n879\t\n880\t    '\n881\t  expected_results:\n882\t    papers_surveyed: 8\n883\t    key_distinction: training-time mining (ours) vs inference-time graph navigation\n884\t    complementarity_evidence: 'All 8 methods operate at inference time; StructFuse\n885\t      mines at training time. The two approaches are complementary — StructFuse improves\n886\t      the base retriever that graph methods navigate over.\n887\t\n888\t      '\n889\t    papers_list:\n890\t    - CodexGraph\n891\t    - LocAgent\n892\t    - RANGER\n893\t    - GraphCoder\n894\t    - ARISE\n895\t    - RepoGraph\n896\t    - CodeGRAG\n897\t    - CodeRAG\n898\t  result_rationale: '8 篇 inference-time graph 方法均在推理阶段构建/遍历代码图，而 StructFuse 在训练阶段\n899\t    通过 negative mining 将结构信号蒸馏进 encoder。两者正交：StructFuse 产出更好的 base retriever，inference-time\n900\t    方法在此基础上进一步 re-rank/navigate。无直接可比性因为 实验设置完全不同（LocAgent 用 LLM agent + tool calls，我们用\n901\t    embedding retrieval）。 Discussion section 应明确 \"complementary, not competing\" 的定位。\n902\t\n903\t    '\n904\t  tables:\n905\t  - name: 'Table S3: Comparison with Inference-Time Graph Methods'\n906\t    columns:\n907\t    - Method\n908\t    - Graph Stage\n909\t    - Graph Type\n910\t    - Complementary?\n911\t    rows:\n912\t    - - StructFuse (ours)\n913\t      - Training\n914\t      - Dataflow (CodeQL)\n915\t      - —\n916\t    - - CodexGraph\n917\t      - Inference\n918\t      - Code graph DB\n919\t      - 'Yes'\n920\t    - - LocAgent\n921\t      - Inference\n922\t      - Repo structure\n923\t      - 'Yes'\n924\t    - - RANGER\n925\t      - Inference\n926\t      - Call graph\n927\t      - 'Yes'\n928\t    - - ARISE\n929\t      - Inference\n930\t      - Intra-proc dataflow\n931\t      - Partially (intra only)\n932\t  figures_description: []\n933\t  analysis: 'Discussion 中用 2 段落即可。不要 overclaim StructFuse 优于这些方法——它们解决不同问题。 Highlight:\n934\t    StructFuse 是唯一在 training time 利用结构信号的方法，且不增加 inference cost。\n935\t\n936\t    '\n937\t- name: BM25 Negative Baseline — Closing CoCoHaNeRe Argument\n938\t  plan_id: plan_018\n939\t  description: 'BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略，1+ seed × 2 encoders。 验证 CoCoHaNeRe\n940\t    报告的 \"embedding negatives harm\" 实际是 BM25-proxy artifact。\n941\t\n942\t    '\n943\t  expected_results:\n944\t    qwen:\n945\t      bm25_R1: 0.52\n946\t      random_R1: 0.545\n947\t      embedding_R1: 0.565\n948\t      dataflow_R1: 0.555\n949\t      bm25_minus_random_pp: -2.5\n950\t      embedding_minus_bm25_pp: 4.5\n951\t    starcoder:\n952\t      bm25_R1: 0.433\n953\t      random_R1: 0.46\n954\t      embedding_R1: 0.475\n955\t      dataflow_R1: 0.458\n956\t      bm25_minus_random_pp: -2.7\n957\t      embedding_minus_bm25_pp: 4.2\n958\t    bm25_harms_both_encoders: true\n959\t    cocohanere_artifact_confirmed: true\n960\t    bm25_minus_random_avg_pp: -2.6\n961\t  result_rationale: 'BM25 negatives 在两个 encoder 上均 harm performance（Qwen -2.5pp, StarCoder\n962\t    -2.7pp vs random），直接复现了 CoCoHaNeRe 报告的负面效果方向。关键 insight：BM25 negatives 选取的是 lexically\n963\t    similar 但 semantically ambiguous 的文件——它们与 query 共享大量 token overlap（function names,\n964\t    variable names, import patterns），但这种 overlap 恰恰是 contrastive learning 需要利用来区分\n965\t    positive/negative 的信号。用 BM25 选的 negatives 让模型学会 ignore lexical cues，但这些 cues 在\n966\t    code retrieval 中是有效信号。 相比之下，true embedding distance negatives 选取的是 semantically\n967\t    similar（在 pretrained embedding space 中近）但与 query 不同的文件，这迫使模型学习更 fine-grained semantic\n968\t    distinctions。BM25 vs embedding 的 4.5pp 差距（Qwen）是论文中最大的 single pairwise comparison，构成\n969\t    Claim 1 correction argument 的 empirical closure。 效果幅度在 bm25_minus_random_R1_pp\n970\t    [-4.0, -1.5] 范围内。\n971\t\n972\t    '\n973\t  tables:\n974\t  - name: 'Table 3: Full 4-Strategy Comparison Including BM25 Baseline'\n975\t    columns:\n976\t    - Encoder\n977\t    - Strategy\n978\t    - R@1 (%)\n979\t    - 95% CI\n980\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n981\t    rows:\n982\t    - - Qwen\n983\t      - BM25\n984\t      - 52.0\n985\t      - '[51.2, 52.8]'\n986\t      - −2.5\n987\t    - - Qwen\n988\t      - random\n989\t      - 54.5\n990\t      - '[53.8, 55.2]'\n991\t      - —\n992\t    - - Qwen\n993\t      - dataflow\n994\t      - 55.5\n995\t      - '[54.6, 56.4]'\n996\t      - '+1.0'\n997\t    - - Qwen\n998\t      - embedding\n999\t      - 56.5\n1000\t      - '[55.8, 57.2]'\n1001\t      - '+2.0'\n1002\t    - - StarCoder\n1003\t      - BM25\n1004\t      - 43.3\n1005\t      - '[42.3, 44.3]'\n1006\t      - −2.7\n1007\t    - - StarCoder\n1008\t      - random\n1009\t      - 46.0\n1010\t      - '[45.1, 46.9]'\n1011\t      - —\n1012\t    - - StarCoder\n1013\t      - dataflow\n1014\t      - 45.8\n1015\t      - '[44.8, 46.8]'\n1016\t      - −0.2\n1017\t    - - StarCoder\n1018\t      - embedding\n1019\t      - 47.5\n1020\t      - '[46.6, 48.4]'\n1021\t      - '+1.5'\n1022\t  figures_description:\n1023\t  - 'Fig 3: 4-strategy R@1 bar chart with BM25 highlighted in red, showing the harm\n1024\t    direction. Annotation arrow from BM25 to embedding with ''4.5pp gap — the CoCoHaNeRe\n1025\t    artifact'''\n1026\t  - 'Fig 4: Neg similarity distribution histograms for BM25 vs embedding vs random\n1027\t    vs dataflow, showing BM25 occupies a different region of similarity space'\n1028\t  analysis: 'BM25 baseline 是 best tier 论文的 crown jewel experiment。它将 Claim 1 从 \"argumentative\n1029\t    correction\" 升级为 \"empirical demonstration\"：我们不仅指出 CoCoHaNeRe 用了 BM25 proxy， 还实际运行\n1030\t    BM25 negatives 复现了 harm effect，然后展示 true embedding negatives 方向相反。 4-strategy\n1031\t    ordering BM25 < random < dataflow ≤ embedding 清晰展示了 negative mining strategy 的\n1032\t    quality spectrum。Reviewer 对 \"correction without evidence\" 的 concern 被彻底关闭。\n1033\t\n1034\t    '\n1035\t- name: Pool Size Sensitivity (50/100/200/500)\n1036\t  plan_id: plan_019\n1037\t  description: '在 SWE-smith validation 上用 pool={50, 100, 200, 500} 重新评估 M2 best checkpoints，\n1038\t    测试 strategy ranking 在更 realistic pool sizes 下的稳定性。\n1039\t\n1040\t    '\n1041\t  expected_results:\n1042\t    qwen:\n1043\t      pool_50:\n1044\t        random_R1: 0.545\n1045\t        embedding_R1: 0.565\n1046\t        dataflow_R1: 0.555\n1047\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n1048\t      pool_100:\n1049\t        random_R1: 0.428\n1050\t        embedding_R1: 0.447\n1051\t        dataflow_R1: 0.438\n1052\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.9\n1053\t      pool_200:\n1054\t        random_R1: 0.342\n1055\t        embedding_R1: 0.359\n1056\t        dataflow_R1: 0.351\n1057\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.7\n1058\t      pool_500:\n1059\t        random_R1: 0.261\n1060\t        embedding_R1: 0.276\n1061\t        dataflow_R1: 0.269\n1062\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n1063\t    starcoder:\n1064\t      pool_50:\n1065\t        random_R1: 0.46\n1066\t        embedding_R1: 0.475\n1067\t        dataflow_R1: 0.458\n1068\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n1069\t      pool_100:\n1070\t        random_R1: 0.358\n1071\t        embedding_R1: 0.372\n1072\t        dataflow_R1: 0.357\n1073\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n1074\t      pool_200:\n1075\t        random_R1: 0.282\n1076\t        embedding_R1: 0.295\n1077\t        dataflow_R1: 0.281\n1078\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n1079\t      pool_500:\n1080\t        random_R1: 0.214\n1081\t        embedding_R1: 0.225\n1082\t        dataflow_R1: 0.213\n1083\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.1\n1084\t    ranking_stable_across_pools: true\n1085\t    pool_ranking_stable_pct: 100\n1086\t    delta_shrinkage_rate: ~0.15pp per doubling of pool size\n1087\t  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding\n1088\t    > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在 pool 50→500 全程保持稳定（pool_ranking_stable_pct\n1089\t    = 100%）。 绝对 R@1 随 pool 增大而下降（50→500 约 halved），因为 larger pool = more distractors\n1090\t    = harder task。Embedding-random delta 从 2.0pp (pool=50) 缓慢缩小至 1.5pp (pool=500)，\n1091\t    缩小幅度约 25%，但方向和显著性保持。原因：pool=500 时 random negatives 中偶然出现 \"hard\" negative 的概率增加（base\n1092\t    rate effect），部分缩小了 mining 策略的差异。 但核心 signal 不消失——embedding mining 在 pool=500 仍有\n1093\t    +1.5pp Qwen, +1.1pp StarCoder。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上从 +1.0pp (pool=50) 降至 +0.8pp (pool=500)\n1094\t    但保持正值。 这直接回应 reviewer \"pool=50 unrealistically small\" concern：即使 10x pool 扩大，\n1095\t    strategy ranking 完全不翻转。\n1096\t\n1097\t    '\n1098\t  tables:\n1099\t  - name: 'Table 12: Pool Size Sensitivity (R@1 %)'\n1100\t    columns:\n1101\t    - Pool\n1102\t    - Encoder\n1103\t    - random\n1104\t    - embedding\n1105\t    - dataflow\n1106\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n1107\t    - Ranking\n1108\t    rows:\n1109\t    - - 50\n1110\t      - Qwen\n1111\t      - 54.5\n1112\t      - 56.5\n1113\t      - 55.5\n1114\t      - '+2.0'\n1115\t      - E>D>R\n1116\t    - - 100\n1117\t      - Qwen\n1118\t      - 42.8\n1119\t      - 44.7\n1120\t      - 43.8\n1121\t      - '+1.9'\n1122\t      - E>D>R\n1123\t    - - 200\n1124\t      - Qwen\n1125\t      - 34.2\n1126\t      - 35.9\n1127\t      - 35.1\n1128\t      - '+1.7'\n1129\t      - E>D>R\n1130\t    - - 500\n1131\t      - Qwen\n1132\t      - 26.1\n1133\t      - 27.6\n1134\t      - 26.9\n1135\t      - '+1.5'\n1136\t      - E>D>R\n1137\t    - - 50\n1138\t      - StarCoder\n1139\t      - 46.0\n1140\t      - 47.5\n1141\t      - 45.8\n1142\t      - '+1.5'\n1143\t      - E>R>D\n1144\t    - - 100\n1145\t      - StarCoder\n1146\t      - 35.8\n1147\t      - 37.2\n1148\t      - 35.7\n1149\t      - '+1.4'\n1150\t      - E>R>D\n1151\t    - - 200\n1152\t      - StarCoder\n1153\t      - 28.2\n1154\t      - 29.5\n1155\t      - 28.1\n1156\t      - '+1.3'\n1157\t      - E>R≈D\n1158\t    - - 500\n1159\t      - StarCoder\n1160\t      - 21.4\n1161\t      - 22.5\n1162\t      - 21.3\n1163\t      - '+1.1'\n1164\t      - E>R≈D\n1165\t  figures_description:\n1166\t  - 'Fig 10: Pool size (x-axis, log scale) vs R@1 (y-axis) for 3 strategies, separate\n1167\t    panels for Qwen and StarCoder. Shaded bands between embedding and random lines\n1168\t    highlight persistent delta.'\n1169\t  - 'Fig 10b: Delta (embedding − random) vs pool size, showing graceful degradation'\n1170\t  analysis: Pool size sensitivity 是外部有效性的关键证据。100% ranking stability 在 50→500 全程保持是\n1171\t    best tier 的标志。Delta 的 graceful degradation（非 collapse）说明 mining strategy 的价值是\n1172\t    robust 的。论文可以明确声明：\"Strategy rankings are stable across pool sizes spanning an\n1173\t    order of magnitude (50–500), with embedding mining maintaining a statistically\n1174\t    significant advantage even at the largest pool tested.\"\n1175\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ef1befa8-2efd-49dd-aab6-f69049f8448e","uuid":"11925cc0-1e69-40e7-979d-23db2ba19f11","timestamp":"2026-05-14T16:58:47.135Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T162530/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '全 18 runs（9 seeds × 2 encoders × 3 strategies）完整复现 pilot pattern。\n  Embedding mining 在两个 encoder 上均显著优于 random（Qwen +2.0pp, StarCoder +1.5pp, 95% CI\n  下界 > 0）。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上条件性获益（+1.0pp, CI 下界 > 0），StarCoder 上无显著差异（-0.2pp, CI 含零）。\n  BM25 baseline 实证关闭 CoCoHaNeRe 论证（BM25 vs random: Qwen -2.5pp, StarCoder -2.7pp）。\n  SWE-bench Lite downstream +2.5pp embedding, +3.2pp dataflow resolve rate delta。\n  三条 claim 原样成立，EMNLP Main 强投 framing 无需调整。 M2 full anchors — Qwen random R@1=0.545,\n  embedding=0.565, dataflow=0.555; StarCoder random R@1=0.460, embedding=0.475, dataflow=0.458。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: SWE-bench Lite End-to-End Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '3 strategies × best Qwen checkpoint, Qwen3.6-27B agent, 300 SWE-bench\n    Lite instances. Retriever 提供 top-k context files，agent 生成 patch，评估 resolve rate。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    random_resolve_rate: 0.22\n    random_resolved_count: 66\n    embedding_resolve_rate: 0.245\n    embedding_resolved_count: 73\n    dataflow_resolve_rate: 0.252\n    dataflow_resolved_count: 76\n    embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.5\n    dataflow_minus_random_pp: 3.2\n    dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: 0.7\n    total_instances: 300\n    retriever_top_k: 5\n    agent_model: Qwen3.6-27B\n  result_rationale: 'Embedding retriever 在 SWE-bench 上提升 +2.5pp，因为 bug-fix patch 通常涉及与\n    issue 描述 语义相似但非完全匹配的文件——embedding mining 训练使 retriever 更擅长区分\"近似但无关\" 与\"近似且相关\"的文件。Dataflow\n    额外提升 +0.7pp（总 +3.2pp vs random）因为 SWE-bench patch 经常跨函数/跨模块（约 40% 涉及 caller-callee\n    关系），dataflow negatives 训练使 retriever 理解\"调用链上的文件更可能共同出现在 patch 中\"。Delta 幅度从 retrieval\n    R@1 的 +2.0/+1.0pp 放大到下游 resolve rate 的 +2.5/+3.2pp，符合检索质量在端到端任务中 的杠杆效应——正确检索一个关键文件可以使原本完全失败的\n    patch 变为可解决。 效果幅度在 swebench_resolve_rate_delta_pp [1.5, 4.0] 范围内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Resolved\n    - Total\n    - Rate (%)\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - random\n      - 66\n      - 300\n      - 22.0\n      - —\n    - - embedding\n      - 73\n      - 300\n      - 24.3\n      - '+2.3'\n    - - dataflow\n      - 76\n      - 300\n      - 25.3\n      - '+3.3'\n  - name: 'Table 4b: SWE-bench by Patch Complexity'\n    columns:\n    - Patch Type\n    - N\n    - random (%)\n    - embedding (%)\n    - dataflow (%)\n    rows:\n    - - single-file\n      - 189\n      - 28.0\n      - 30.7\n      - 30.2\n    - - multi-file\n      - 111\n      - 11.7\n      - 14.4\n      - 17.1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: SWE-bench resolve rate bar chart (3 strategies) with bootstrap 95% CI\n    whiskers'\n  - 'Fig 5b: Scatter plot — retrieval R@1 rank vs resolve rate per instance, colored\n    by strategy'\n  analysis: 'Multi-file patches（占 37%）是 dataflow 拉开差距的主要来源：dataflow 在 multi-file 上\n    +5.4pp vs random，远大于 single-file 的 +2.2pp。这与 Claim 2 一致——dataflow negatives 使\n    retriever 更好地理解跨模块依赖。Embedding vs random 在 multi-file 上也有 +2.7pp，说明更难的 negatives\n    普遍有益。总体 resolve rate 22-25% 与 SweRank/SWE-Fixer 文献报告的 retriever-only baseline\n    一致。\n\n    '\n- name: RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval with Multi-Seed CIs\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'RepoBench-R test_easy (pool ~6) 和 test_hard (pool ~18) 上评估 9 seeds\n    × 3 strategies × 2 encoders，报告 R@1 均值 + 95% bootstrap CI。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_test_hard:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.621\n      random_R1_ci:\n      - 0.614\n      - 0.628\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.642\n      embedding_R1_ci:\n      - 0.634\n      - 0.65\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.633\n      dataflow_R1_ci:\n      - 0.624\n      - 0.642\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.1\n      dataflow_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n    qwen_test_easy:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.843\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.855\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.85\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n    starcoder_test_hard:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.574\n      random_R1_ci:\n      - 0.566\n      - 0.582\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.589\n      embedding_R1_ci:\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.598\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.572\n      dataflow_R1_ci:\n      - 0.562\n      - 0.582\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n      dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.2\n    starcoder_test_easy:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.812\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.822\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.81\n    repobench_R1_delta_pp_embedding_avg: 1.8\n    bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp_avg: 1.2\n  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 是 cross-file completion 任务，pool 更小（6-18），绝对 R@1 更高。\n    Embedding mining 在两个 encoder 上均显著提升 test_hard R@1（Qwen +2.1pp, StarCoder +1.5pp），\n    因为 pool=18 仍有足够 distractors 使 mining 质量差异体现。Test_easy pool=6 接近 ceiling，delta\n    被压缩但方向一致。Dataflow 在 Qwen test_hard 上 +1.2pp 但 CI 刚好 排除零，StarCoder 上无效（-0.2pp，CI\n    含零）——与 SWE-smith 上的 encoder-strategy interaction 完全一致，说明 pattern 跨 benchmark 稳定。CI\n    宽度 ~1.2pp 在 bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp [0.5, 2.0] 范围内，9 seeds 提供足够统计功效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Strategy\n    - R@1 (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - random\n      - 62.1\n      - '[61.4, 62.8]'\n      - —\n    - - Qwen\n      - embedding\n      - 64.2\n      - '[63.4, 65.0]'\n      - '+2.1'\n    - - Qwen\n      - dataflow\n      - 63.3\n      - '[62.4, 64.2]'\n      - '+1.2'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - random\n      - 57.4\n      - '[56.6, 58.2]'\n      - —\n    - - StarCoder\n      - embedding\n      - 58.9\n      - '[58.0, 59.8]'\n      - '+1.5'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - dataflow\n      - 57.2\n      - '[56.2, 58.2]'\n      - −0.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: RepoBench-R R@1 grouped bar chart (2 encoders × 3 strategies) with CI\n    whiskers, test_easy vs test_hard side by side'\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark 一致性是 best tier 的关键证据：embedding mining 在 SWE-smith 和 RepoBench-R\n    上均显著提升两个 encoder，dataflow 条件性获益仅限 Qwen。这排除了 \"结果仅限单一 benchmark\" 的 reviewer concern。Test_easy\n    上 delta 被压缩（pool=6 ceiling effect）是预期行为，反向验证了 pool size 对绝对效果幅度的调节作用。\n\n    '\n- name: Stratified Analysis with Structural Coverage & Neg Difficulty Quartiles\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '5 层分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-positive similarity / structural\n    data availability (34% vs 66%) / neg_difficulty quartile。使用 M2 best checkpoints\n    在 SWE-smith validation 上重新评估。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    stratum_structural_available:\n      with_dataflow_34pct:\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 2.8\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: 1.3\n        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n        n_instances: ~5200\n      fallback_66pct:\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp: -0.2\n        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.3\n        n_instances: ~10000\n    stratum_neg_difficulty_quartile:\n      Q1_easiest:\n        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.3\n      Q2:\n        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.7\n      Q3:\n        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.4\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n      Q4_hardest:\n        qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 3.2\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 2.1\n    stratum_repo_size:\n      small_lt50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.8\n        n: ~500\n      medium_50_200:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.2\n        n: ~4100\n      large_200_500:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.8\n        n: ~5500\n      xlarge_500plus:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.6\n        n: ~5100\n    stratum_pool_size:\n      pool_lt20:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.0\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.3\n      pool_20_50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.1\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.0\n      pool_gt50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.5\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.4\n    stratum_query_pos_sim:\n      high_sim_gt095:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.6\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.8\n      medium_sim_085_095:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.9\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.8\n      low_sim_lt085:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.2\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.2\n  result_rationale: 'Structural-available stratum（34%）上 dataflow 优势放大到 +2.8pp（Qwen），因为这些\n    instance 实际接收了 dataflow-disconnected negatives——真实训练信号未被 fallback 稀释。 Fallback\n    stratum（66%）上 dataflow ≈ embedding（±0.2pp），因为 fallback 时 dataflow 策略退化为 embedding\n    或 random 选择，无结构信号注入。这一分解直接回应 reviewer 关于 \"34% coverage 稀释 signal\" 的 concern——真实\n    per-instance 效果是 +2.8pp 而非 pooled +1.0pp。Neg_difficulty Q4（最难 quartile）上 delta\n    最大（embedding +3.2pp, dataflow +2.1pp），符合 representation saturation 理论——Qwen 在高\n    pos_sim 区域最需要 harder negatives，而 Q4 恰好是 margin 最小、分辨最难的 instances。Q1（最容易）delta\n    最小 因为 random negatives 已经足够容易区分。Repo size 上 small repo delta 更大因为 小 repo 的 candidate\n    pool 更集中，mining 策略差异更容易体现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Stratified R@1 Delta by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Stratum\n    - N\n    - random R@1\n    - embedding R@1\n    - dataflow R@1\n    - df−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - With dataflow (34%)\n      - ~5.2K\n      - 53.1\n      - 55.4\n      - 55.9\n      - '+2.8'\n    - - Fallback (66%)\n      - ~10K\n      - 55.2\n      - 57.3\n      - 55.3\n      - '+0.1'\n    - - Overall\n      - ~15.2K\n      - 54.5\n      - 56.5\n      - 55.5\n      - '+1.0'\n  - name: 'Table 7b: R@1 Delta by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Quartile\n    - margin_mean\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - df−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Q1 (easiest)\n      - 0.142\n      - '+0.8'\n      - '+0.3'\n    - - Q2\n      - 0.078\n      - '+1.5'\n      - '+0.7'\n    - - Q3\n      - 0.031\n      - '+2.4'\n      - '+1.2'\n    - - Q4 (hardest)\n      - 0.008\n      - '+3.2'\n      - '+2.1'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: Heatmap — R@1 delta (strategy × stratum), separate panels for Qwen and\n    StarCoder'\n  - 'Fig 8: Neg difficulty quartile vs R@1 delta line plot, 3 strategies overlaid'\n  analysis: 'Stratified analysis 提供了论文中最强的 mechanistic 证据。Neg_difficulty Q4 的 +3.2pp\n    embedding delta 是 overall +2.0pp 的 1.6 倍——越难的 instances 从 harder negatives 获益越多，这是\n    representation saturation 理论的直接预测。Structural-available vs fallback 分解消除了 \"diluted\n    signal\" concern 并揭示 dataflow 的真实 per-instance 效果（+2.8pp）远大于 pooled 报告值。\n\n    '\n- name: Call-Graph Hop Depth Ablation (1/2/3-hop)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '比较 1-hop / 2-hop / 3-hop call-graph bounding 对 dataflow negative 质量的影响。\n    Qwen encoder, 1 seed, SWE-smith validation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    hop_1:\n      R1: 0.548\n      connected_coverage_pct: 12.4\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 18.2\n    hop_2:\n      R1: 0.555\n      connected_coverage_pct: 34.3\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 31.7\n    hop_3:\n      R1: 0.551\n      connected_coverage_pct: 58.6\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 42.1\n    optimal_hop: 2\n    hop2_minus_hop1_pp: 0.7\n    hop3_minus_hop2_pp: -0.4\n  result_rationale: '2-hop 是最优平衡点。1-hop 太保守——仅 12.4% coverage 意味着大部分 instance 没有足够的\n    connected 节点来定义 \"disconnected\" negatives，退化为 random。3-hop 过于宽松——58.6% coverage\n    下 \"disconnected\" 的定义变得太窄，许多语义相关但间接连接的文件被错误排除在 negative pool 外，引入噪声。2-hop 的 34.3%\n    coverage（与 M1 extraction 的 structural data rate 一致）在 \"enough connected nodes to\n    define meaningful disconnection\" 和 \"disconnected set still contains genuinely\n    unrelated files\" 之间取得平衡。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)'\n    columns:\n    - Hops\n    - Coverage (%)\n    - Neg/query\n    - R@1 (%)\n    - Δ vs 2-hop (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 12.4\n      - 18.2\n      - 54.8\n      - −0.7\n    - - 2\n      - 34.3\n      - 31.7\n      - 55.5\n      - —\n    - - 3\n      - 58.6\n      - 42.1\n      - 55.1\n      - −0.4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: Hop depth vs R@1 line plot with coverage % on secondary y-axis'\n  analysis: '2-hop optimal 符合 inter-procedural dataflow 的语义：1-hop = 直接 caller/callee，\n    2-hop = caller 的 caller 或 callee 的 callee（一层间接调用），3-hop 开始包含 过于间接的关系。论文可以强调 2-hop\n    选择有 principled 依据而非纯粹 empirical tuning。\n\n    '\n- name: Training Data Size Scaling (1K/3K/5K)\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '固定 Qwen encoder + embedding strategy，训练数据从 1K / 3K / 5K instances\n    增长， 观察 R@1 变化和策略排名稳定性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    size_1K:\n      random_R1: 0.51\n      embedding_R1: 0.522\n      dataflow_R1: 0.515\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n      seed_std: 0.015\n    size_3K:\n      random_R1: 0.532\n      embedding_R1: 0.55\n      dataflow_R1: 0.541\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.8\n      seed_std: 0.01\n    size_5K:\n      random_R1: 0.545\n      embedding_R1: 0.565\n      dataflow_R1: 0.555\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n      seed_std: 0.008\n    ranking_stable: true\n    monotonic_improvement: true\n  result_rationale: '策略排名在 1K/3K/5K 三个尺度上保持一致（embedding > dataflow > random），但 delta\n    幅度随数据量增大而增大——1K 时 +1.2pp，5K 时 +2.0pp。这是因为更大的训练集提供更多 diverse negatives，使 mining\n    策略的差异更充分地体现。1K 时 seed 方差较大（std=0.015） 因为 negative 多样性不足，个别 seed 的 negative 采样偶然性影响结果。5K\n    时方差收敛 （std=0.008），mining 策略的信号超过采样噪声。No diminishing returns at 5K suggests further\n    scaling could help, but is beyond scope。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Data Size Scaling (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Size\n    - random R@1\n    - embedding R@1\n    - dataflow R@1\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - σ across seeds\n    rows:\n    - - 1K\n      - 51.0\n      - 52.2\n      - 51.5\n      - '+1.2'\n      - 1.5\n    - - 3K\n      - 53.2\n      - 55.0\n      - 54.1\n      - '+1.8'\n      - 1.0\n    - - 5K\n      - 54.5\n      - 56.5\n      - 55.5\n      - '+2.0'\n      - 0.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S2: R@1 vs training size for 3 strategies, with shaded seed variance bands'\n  analysis: 'Monotonic scaling + stable ranking 表明结果不是 small-data artifact。5K 时未见\n    diminishing returns，暗示更大数据集可能进一步放大差异。这对 reviewer \"effect size marginal\" concern\n    有价值——delta 仍在增长，当前 +2.0pp 是下界而非上界。\n\n    '\n- name: Fusion Head Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '比较 embedding-only / structural-features-only / combined fusion head，\n    隔离 training-time mining 价值与 inference-time feature injection。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_only:\n      qwen_R1: 0.565\n      starcoder_R1: 0.475\n    structural_features_only:\n      qwen_R1: 0.498\n      starcoder_R1: 0.421\n    combined_fusion:\n      qwen_R1: 0.561\n      starcoder_R1: 0.472\n    embedding_only_minus_combined_pp: 0.4\n    conclusion: mining > fusion; structural features at inference add noise\n  result_rationale: 'Embedding-only（仅用 embedding mining 训练的 retriever，inference 时不注入结构特征）\n    表现最好或 tied with combined。Combined fusion 略低 0.4pp 因为 inference-time structural\n    features 引入了不精确的 CodeQL connectivity 信号——recall 某些 CodeQL extraction 失败的 instance\n    反而被错误降权。Structural-features-only（不用 mining 训练， 仅在 inference 注入结构特征）远低于 embedding-only（-6.7pp\n    Qwen），证明核心价值在 training-time negative mining 而非 inference-time feature engineering。\n    这一结果对 paper framing 极为重要：StructFuse 的贡献是 mining strategy，不是 fusion。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Fusion Head Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n    rows:\n    - - embedding-only (ours)\n      - 56.5\n      - 47.5\n    - - structural-features-only\n      - 49.8\n      - 42.1\n    - - combined fusion\n      - 56.1\n      - 47.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S3: Ablation bar chart comparing 3 fusion configurations'\n  analysis: '训练时注入 structural signal 通过 negative mining（间接信号）比 inference 时直接注入 structural\n    features（直接信号）更有效。可能原因：mining 让 encoder 自己学习结构相关的 representation，而直接注入 features\n    绕过了 encoder 的学习过程，且 CodeQL 34% coverage 意味着 66% instance 在 inference 时收到 zero-vector\n    structural features，引入 noise。\n\n    '\n- name: Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '比较 binary connected/disconnected 与 dataflow-distance weighted negative\n    sampling。 Weighted: disconnected 且 hop-distance 更远的文件被赋予更高采样概率。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    binary_qwen_R1: 0.555\n    weighted_qwen_R1: 0.558\n    binary_starcoder_R1: 0.458\n    weighted_starcoder_R1: 0.459\n    weighted_minus_binary_qwen_pp: 0.3\n    weighted_minus_binary_starcoder_pp: 0.1\n  result_rationale: 'Weighted 在 Qwen 上仅微弱提升 +0.3pp（不显著），StarCoder 上几乎无差异。 原因：binary\n    disconnected/connected 已经捕获了最关键的 structural distinction—— \"是否在调用链上\"。进一步按 hop distance\n    加权引入的额外信号被 noise 抵消：距离更远 不一定意味着更好的 negative（一个完全无关的 utility 文件可能 hop=∞ 但也是 trivial\n    negative）。 Binary 的简洁性是优势——fewer hyperparameters, same effect。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S1: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n    - Δ vs Binary (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Binary (default)\n      - 55.5\n      - 45.8\n      - —\n    - - Distance-weighted\n      - 55.8\n      - 45.9\n      - +0.3 / +0.1\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Binary is sufficient — complexity of weighted sampling not justified.\n    论文可在 ablation section 用一句话报告这一 negative result， 强化 \"simple binary structural signal\n    is the key insight\" 的 narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: SWE-bench Failure Analysis (50 cases)\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '从 random retriever 的 SWE-bench 失败案例中抽样 50 个，人工分类失败原因， 标注 dataflow\n    信号是否可能帮助。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_analyzed: 50\n    category_breakdown:\n      retrieval_failure_wrong_files: 22\n      retrieval_success_but_agent_fail: 15\n      insufficient_context_window: 7\n      test_environment_issue: 4\n      ambiguous_issue_description: 2\n    dataflow_could_help:\n      true: 14\n      partially: 5\n      false: 31\n    dataflow_help_rate: 0.28\n    key_pattern: '14/22 retrieval failures involve cross-module dependencies where\n      the gold file is a caller/callee of a retrieved-but-wrong file — dataflow connectivity\n      would directly address these.\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: '50 个失败中 22 个是 retrieval failure（检索到错误文件），其中 14 个涉及跨模块依赖—— 被检索的文件和\n    gold 文件有高文本相似度但分属不同 call chain。Dataflow negatives 训练 恰好针对这类 confound。15 个 retrieval\n    success but agent fail 说明 retrieval 不是 唯一瓶颈——agent 的 patch 生成能力也是限制因素。这为论文提供了\n    \"ceiling analysis\"： 即使 perfect retrieval，resolve rate 上限约 85%（15% 是 agent 能力限制）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2: Failure Category Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Count\n    - '% of 50'\n    - Dataflow Could Help?\n    rows:\n    - - 'Retrieval: wrong files'\n      - 22\n      - 44\n      - 14/22 (64%)\n    - - Retrieval OK, agent fail\n      - 15\n      - 30\n      - N/A\n    - - Context window limit\n      - 7\n      - 14\n      - 5/7 partially\n    - - Test env issue\n      - 4\n      - 8\n      - 'No'\n    - - Ambiguous issue\n      - 2\n      - 4\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S4: Sankey diagram — failure flow from retrieval stage to resolution outcome'\n  analysis: '28% of failures could benefit from dataflow signal, consistent with the\n    observed +3.2pp resolve rate improvement. The 64% rate within retrieval failures\n    confirms that cross-module dependency is the primary retrieval challenge, directly\n    supporting Claim 2''s motivation.\n\n    '\n- name: Qualitative Examples (5-10 cases)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: '从 SWE-bench 和 SWE-smith 中选取 5-10 个 dataflow negatives 改变检索结果的典型案例，\n    展示 structural signal 的具体作用机制。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_examples: 8\n    example_categories:\n      caller_callee_confusion: 3\n      utility_file_distraction: 2\n      cross_module_import_chain: 2\n      test_file_vs_source: 1\n    illustrative_example:\n      issue: django/django#12345 — QuerySet.filter() returns wrong results with nested\n        Q objects\n      random_retriever_top1: django/db/models/query.py (text match on 'filter')\n      dataflow_retriever_top1: django/db/models/sql/query.py (actual SQL generation\n        called by filter)\n      gold: django/db/models/sql/query.py\n      explanation: 'Random retriever picks query.py (contains ''filter'' method signature)\n        but the bug is in sql/query.py (the downstream SQL builder called by filter).\n        Dataflow training teaches the model that sql/query.py is structurally connected\n        to query.py via 2-hop call chain, making it a better negative for other instances,\n        which in turn improves the model''s ability to rank the actual implementation\n        file higher.\n\n        '\n  result_rationale: '8 个案例覆盖 4 个失败模式：caller-callee confusion（3 个，最常见——文本相似的 wrapper\n    函数 vs 实际实现）、utility file distraction（2 个——高文本重叠的 helper 文件干扰）、 cross-module import\n    chain（2 个——A 导入 B 导入 C，bug 在 C 但文本匹配 A）、test vs source（1 个——test file 包含几乎完整的\n    source code 复制）。这些案例具体展示了 \"lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance\" 的核心 insight。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9: Side-by-side retrieval ranking visualization for 3 representative cases,\n    showing file dependency graph with highlighted paths'\n  analysis: 'Qualitative examples serve as the paper''s \"aha moment\" — they make the\n    abstract representation geometry argument concrete. Reviewer-facing value: even\n    skeptics who question statistical significance can see the mechanism operating\n    on real code.\n\n    '\n- name: Temperature Ablation τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: '3 temperatures × 3 strategies × 2 encoders, 1 seed each. 测试 strategy\n    ranking 是否 regime-specific。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tau_005:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.558\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.577\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.569\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.9\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.47\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.485\n      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.467\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n    tau_010:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.545\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.565\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.555\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.46\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.475\n      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.458\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n    tau_020:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.53\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.546\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.538\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.6\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.448\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.461\n      starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.447\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n    ranking_preserved_across_tau: true\n    optimal_tau: 0.05\n  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding\n    > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在三个 temperature 下保持一致。τ=0.05 绝对性能最高因为 sharper\n    temperature 使 contrastive loss 更有效地区分相似度差异（harder gradient signal）。 τ=0.2 下所有策略性能下降且\n    delta 缩小（1.6pp vs 2.0pp），因为 softer temperature 减弱了 negative 选择质量的影响——当所有 similarity\n    被压缩到窄范围内，hard vs easy negatives 的梯度差异变小。关键结论：findings 不是 temperature-regime-specific，\n    直接回应 median reviewer 的 \"τ=0.05 unusually low\" concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Temperature Ablation (R@1 %)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - Encoder\n    - random\n    - embedding\n    - dataflow\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 0.05\n      - Qwen\n      - 55.8\n      - 57.7\n      - 56.9\n      - '+1.9'\n    - - 0.05\n      - StarCoder\n      - 47.0\n      - 48.5\n      - 46.7\n      - '+1.5'\n    - - 0.1\n      - Qwen\n      - 54.5\n      - 56.5\n      - 55.5\n      - '+2.0'\n    - - 0.1\n      - StarCoder\n      - 46.0\n      - 47.5\n      - 45.8\n      - '+1.5'\n    - - 0.2\n      - Qwen\n      - 53.0\n      - 54.6\n      - 53.8\n      - '+1.6'\n    - - 0.2\n      - StarCoder\n      - 44.8\n      - 46.1\n      - 44.7\n      - '+1.3'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S5: Temperature × strategy interaction plot (R@1 on y-axis, τ on x-axis,\n    separate lines per strategy)'\n  analysis: 'Ranking stability across τ 是重要的 robustness evidence。τ=0.2 下 delta 缩小但\n    不翻转，说明 mining quality 的价值在不同 loss sharpness 下都存在。Paper 可以报告 τ=0.05 作为 alternative\n    best configuration 但选择 τ=0.1 作为 default（更常见的 literature default）。\n\n    '\n- name: Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: 'Dynamic: 每 epoch 重新用当前 encoder 挖 embedding negatives。 Static: 仅用 pretrained\n    encoder 挖一次（当前做法）。 Qwen + StarCoder, 1 seed each。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_static_R1: 0.565\n    qwen_dynamic_R1: 0.568\n    qwen_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.3\n    starcoder_static_R1: 0.475\n    starcoder_dynamic_R1: 0.477\n    starcoder_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.2\n    dynamic_significant: false\n    curriculum_confound_ruled_out: true\n  result_rationale: 'Dynamic mining 仅微弱提升 +0.2-0.3pp（不显著），因为 LoRA rank 16 的 fine-tuning\n    只轻微改变 embedding space——pretrained encoder 的 nearest neighbors 在训练后 仍然大部分相同。这排除了\n    \"static mining 的优势来自 curriculum effect（early epochs 看到 harder negatives 然后 negatives\n    变 stale）\" 的 confound——即使更新 negatives， 效果几乎不变。对 Claim 2 很重要：说明 mining strategy\n    的选择（what to mine）比 mining schedule（when to mine）更关键。Dynamic mining 的 compute overhead（每\n    epoch 重新 encode + kNN）不 justified。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Static R@1 (%)\n    - Dynamic R@1 (%)\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 56.5\n      - 56.8\n      - '+0.3'\n      - 0.41\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 47.5\n      - 47.7\n      - '+0.2'\n      - 0.53\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S6: Learning curves for static vs dynamic mining, overlaid'\n  analysis: 'Static ≈ dynamic 是 clean negative result，强化了论文 narrative：关键是 negative\n    的 semantic quality（embedding vs random vs dataflow），不是 freshness。 也简化了 practitioner\n    recommendation——mine once from pretrained, no need for per-epoch re-mining。\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap CIs for SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: '对 plan_003 的 SWE-bench 结果计算 10K bootstrap resamples 的 95% CI， 报告 paired\n    difference CIs 和 p-values。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_minus_random:\n      delta_pp: 2.5\n      ci_95:\n      - 0.7\n      - 4.3\n      p_value: 0.018\n      significant: true\n    dataflow_minus_random:\n      delta_pp: 3.2\n      ci_95:\n      - 1.0\n      - 5.5\n      p_value: 0.008\n      significant: true\n    dataflow_minus_embedding:\n      delta_pp: 0.7\n      ci_95:\n      - -1.5\n      - 2.9\n      p_value: 0.134\n      significant: false\n    bootstrap_n: 10000\n    sample_size: 300\n  result_rationale: 'Embedding vs random CI [0.7, 4.3] 排除零（p=0.018），确认 embedding mining\n    在下游 任务上的统计显著提升。Dataflow vs random 更显著（p=0.008）因为 delta 更大且 SWE-bench 中 cross-module\n    patches 对 dataflow signal 响应一致。Dataflow vs embedding 不显著 （p=0.134, CI 含零）——300\n    instances 的 power 不足以区分 +0.7pp 的小 delta，这是 expected：retrieval level 的 ~1pp 差异在下游\n    binary resolve 结果上被放大和噪声化。 CI 宽度 ~3.6pp 反映 300 样本的 inherent variance——SWE-bench\n    Lite 不是为精确 delta 估计设计的 benchmark。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4c: SWE-bench Bootstrap Significance Tests'\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - embedding − random\n      - '+2.5'\n      - '[+0.7, +4.3]'\n      - 0.018\n    - - dataflow − random\n      - '+3.2'\n      - '[+1.0, +5.5]'\n      - 0.008\n    - - dataflow − embedding\n      - '+0.7'\n      - '[−1.5, +2.9]'\n      - 0.134\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5c: Bootstrap distribution histograms for the 3 pairwise comparisons'\n  analysis: 'CI 下界 > 0 for both mining strategies vs random 是 EMNLP reviewer 需要的统计保证。\n    Dataflow vs embedding 不显著是 honest reporting 且与 Claim 2 的 \"conditional\" framing\n    一致——dataflow 的额外价值不是 universally separable at SWE-bench scale。\n\n    '\n- name: Inference-Time Graph Method Literature Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: '文献分析（非实验）：与 CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER 等 inference-time 图方法的 系统比较。已完成\n    8 篇论文 survey。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    papers_surveyed: 8\n    key_distinction: training-time mining (ours) vs inference-time graph navigation\n    complementarity_evidence: 'All 8 methods operate at inference time; StructFuse\n      mines at training time. The two approaches are complementary — StructFuse improves\n      the base retriever that graph methods navigate over.\n\n      '\n    papers_list:\n    - CodexGraph\n    - LocAgent\n    - RANGER\n    - GraphCoder\n    - ARISE\n    - RepoGraph\n    - CodeGRAG\n    - CodeRAG\n  result_rationale: '8 篇 inference-time graph 方法均在推理阶段构建/遍历代码图，而 StructFuse 在训练阶段\n    通过 negative mining 将结构信号蒸馏进 encoder。两者正交：StructFuse 产出更好的 base retriever，inference-time\n    方法在此基础上进一步 re-rank/navigate。无直接可比性因为 实验设置完全不同（LocAgent 用 LLM agent + tool calls，我们用\n    embedding retrieval）。 Discussion section 应明确 \"complementary, not competing\" 的定位。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3: Comparison with Inference-Time Graph Methods'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Graph Stage\n    - Graph Type\n    - Complementary?\n    rows:\n    - - StructFuse (ours)\n      - Training\n      - Dataflow (CodeQL)\n      - —\n    - - CodexGraph\n      - Inference\n      - Code graph DB\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - LocAgent\n      - Inference\n      - Repo structure\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - RANGER\n      - Inference\n      - Call graph\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - ARISE\n      - Inference\n      - Intra-proc dataflow\n      - Partially (intra only)\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Discussion 中用 2 段落即可。不要 overclaim StructFuse 优于这些方法——它们解决不同问题。 Highlight:\n    StructFuse 是唯一在 training time 利用结构信号的方法，且不增加 inference cost。\n\n    '\n- name: BM25 Negative Baseline — Closing CoCoHaNeRe Argument\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: 'BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略，1+ seed × 2 encoders。 验证 CoCoHaNeRe\n    报告的 \"embedding negatives harm\" 实际是 BM25-proxy artifact。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen:\n      bm25_R1: 0.52\n      random_R1: 0.545\n      embedding_R1: 0.565\n      dataflow_R1: 0.555\n      bm25_minus_random_pp: -2.5\n      embedding_minus_bm25_pp: 4.5\n    starcoder:\n      bm25_R1: 0.433\n      random_R1: 0.46\n      embedding_R1: 0.475\n      dataflow_R1: 0.458\n      bm25_minus_random_pp: -2.7\n      embedding_minus_bm25_pp: 4.2\n    bm25_harms_both_encoders: true\n    cocohanere_artifact_confirmed: true\n    bm25_minus_random_avg_pp: -2.6\n  result_rationale: 'BM25 negatives 在两个 encoder 上均 harm performance（Qwen -2.5pp, StarCoder\n    -2.7pp vs random），直接复现了 CoCoHaNeRe 报告的负面效果方向。关键 insight：BM25 negatives 选取的是 lexically\n    similar 但 semantically ambiguous 的文件——它们与 query 共享大量 token overlap（function names,\n    variable names, import patterns），但这种 overlap 恰恰是 contrastive learning 需要利用来区分\n    positive/negative 的信号。用 BM25 选的 negatives 让模型学会 ignore lexical cues，但这些 cues 在\n    code retrieval 中是有效信号。 相比之下，true embedding distance negatives 选取的是 semantically\n    similar（在 pretrained embedding space 中近）但与 query 不同的文件，这迫使模型学习更 fine-grained semantic\n    distinctions。BM25 vs embedding 的 4.5pp 差距（Qwen）是论文中最大的 single pairwise comparison，构成\n    Claim 1 correction argument 的 empirical closure。 效果幅度在 bm25_minus_random_R1_pp\n    [-4.0, -1.5] 范围内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Full 4-Strategy Comparison Including BM25 Baseline'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Strategy\n    - R@1 (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - BM25\n      - 52.0\n      - '[51.2, 52.8]'\n      - −2.5\n    - - Qwen\n      - random\n      - 54.5\n      - '[53.8, 55.2]'\n      - —\n    - - Qwen\n      - dataflow\n      - 55.5\n      - '[54.6, 56.4]'\n      - '+1.0'\n    - - Qwen\n      - embedding\n      - 56.5\n      - '[55.8, 57.2]'\n      - '+2.0'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - BM25\n      - 43.3\n      - '[42.3, 44.3]'\n      - −2.7\n    - - StarCoder\n      - random\n      - 46.0\n      - '[45.1, 46.9]'\n      - —\n    - - StarCoder\n      - dataflow\n      - 45.8\n      - '[44.8, 46.8]'\n      - −0.2\n    - - StarCoder\n      - embedding\n      - 47.5\n      - '[46.6, 48.4]'\n      - '+1.5'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: 4-strategy R@1 bar chart with BM25 highlighted in red, showing the harm\n    direction. Annotation arrow from BM25 to embedding with ''4.5pp gap — the CoCoHaNeRe\n    artifact'''\n  - 'Fig 4: Neg similarity distribution histograms for BM25 vs embedding vs random\n    vs dataflow, showing BM25 occupies a different region of similarity space'\n  analysis: 'BM25 baseline 是 best tier 论文的 crown jewel experiment。它将 Claim 1 从 \"argumentative\n    correction\" 升级为 \"empirical demonstration\"：我们不仅指出 CoCoHaNeRe 用了 BM25 proxy， 还实际运行\n    BM25 negatives 复现了 harm effect，然后展示 true embedding negatives 方向相反。 4-strategy\n    ordering BM25 < random < dataflow ≤ embedding 清晰展示了 negative mining strategy 的\n    quality spectrum。Reviewer 对 \"correction without evidence\" 的 concern 被彻底关闭。\n\n    '\n- name: Pool Size Sensitivity (50/100/200/500)\n  plan_id: plan_019\n  description: '在 SWE-smith validation 上用 pool={50, 100, 200, 500} 重新评估 M2 best checkpoints，\n    测试 strategy ranking 在更 realistic pool sizes 下的稳定性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen:\n      pool_50:\n        random_R1: 0.545\n        embedding_R1: 0.565\n        dataflow_R1: 0.555\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 2.0\n      pool_100:\n        random_R1: 0.428\n        embedding_R1: 0.447\n        dataflow_R1: 0.438\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.9\n      pool_200:\n        random_R1: 0.342\n        embedding_R1: 0.359\n        dataflow_R1: 0.351\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.7\n      pool_500:\n        random_R1: 0.261\n        embedding_R1: 0.276\n        dataflow_R1: 0.269\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n    starcoder:\n      pool_50:\n        random_R1: 0.46\n        embedding_R1: 0.475\n        dataflow_R1: 0.458\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n      pool_100:\n        random_R1: 0.358\n        embedding_R1: 0.372\n        dataflow_R1: 0.357\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n      pool_200:\n        random_R1: 0.282\n        embedding_R1: 0.295\n        dataflow_R1: 0.281\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n      pool_500:\n        random_R1: 0.214\n        embedding_R1: 0.225\n        dataflow_R1: 0.213\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.1\n    ranking_stable_across_pools: true\n    pool_ranking_stable_pct: 100\n    delta_shrinkage_rate: ~0.15pp per doubling of pool size\n  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding\n    > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在 pool 50→500 全程保持稳定（pool_ranking_stable_pct\n    = 100%）。 绝对 R@1 随 pool 增大而下降（50→500 约 halved），因为 larger pool = more distractors\n    = harder task。Embedding-random delta 从 2.0pp (pool=50) 缓慢缩小至 1.5pp (pool=500)，\n    缩小幅度约 25%，但方向和显著性保持。原因：pool=500 时 random negatives 中偶然出现 \"hard\" negative 的概率增加（base\n    rate effect），部分缩小了 mining 策略的差异。 但核心 signal 不消失——embedding mining 在 pool=500 仍有\n    +1.5pp Qwen, +1.1pp StarCoder。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上从 +1.0pp (pool=50) 降至 +0.8pp (pool=500)\n    但保持正值。 这直接回应 reviewer \"pool=50 unrealistically small\" concern：即使 10x pool 扩大，\n    strategy ranking 完全不翻转。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 12: Pool Size Sensitivity (R@1 %)'\n    columns:\n    - Pool\n    - Encoder\n    - random\n    - embedding\n    - dataflow\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - Ranking\n    rows:\n    - - 50\n      - Qwen\n      - 54.5\n      - 56.5\n      - 55.5\n      - '+2.0'\n      - E>D>R\n    - - 100\n      - Qwen\n      - 42.8\n      - 44.7\n      - 43.8\n      - '+1.9'\n      - E>D>R\n    - - 200\n      - Qwen\n      - 34.2\n      - 35.9\n      - 35.1\n      - '+1.7'\n      - E>D>R\n    - - 500\n      - Qwen\n      - 26.1\n      - 27.6\n      - 26.9\n      - '+1.5'\n      - E>D>R\n    - - 50\n      - StarCoder\n      - 46.0\n      - 47.5\n      - 45.8\n      - '+1.5'\n      - E>R>D\n    - - 100\n      - StarCoder\n      - 35.8\n      - 37.2\n      - 35.7\n      - '+1.4'\n      - E>R>D\n    - - 200\n      - StarCoder\n      - 28.2\n      - 29.5\n      - 28.1\n      - '+1.3'\n      - E>R≈D\n    - - 500\n      - StarCoder\n      - 21.4\n      - 22.5\n      - 21.3\n      - '+1.1'\n      - E>R≈D\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10: Pool size (x-axis, log scale) vs R@1 (y-axis) for 3 strategies, separate\n    panels for Qwen and StarCoder. Shaded bands between embedding and random lines\n    highlight persistent delta.'\n  - 'Fig 10b: Delta (embedding − random) vs pool size, showing graceful degradation'\n  analysis: Pool size sensitivity 是外部有效性的关键证据。100% ranking stability 在 50→500 全程保持是\n    best tier 的标志。Delta 的 graceful degradation（非 collapse）说明 mining strategy 的价值是\n    robust 的。论文可以明确声明：\"Strategy rankings are stable across pool sizes spanning an\n    order of magnitude (50–500), with embedding mining maintaining a statistically\n    significant advantage even at the largest pool tested.\"\n","numLines":1175,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1175}}}
